 "description": "BIGVILLE R11 (block 259000) -- the OPEN ECONOMY + full-agent travellers + the INN. A traveller is a FULL agent (coin/story/goal held-state) that REOCCURS remembered. bw_inn_stay: a passer-through with stay_armed pays lodging_cost -> the inn (internal) GAINS it, the traveller (external) LOSES it, and led.external_influx LOGS the boundary crossing (Sigma-coin conserved internally EXCEPT the logged external point) -- coin INJECTED from outside; visits+1. bw_inn_bond_first mints the innkeeper's `knows` edge on the FIRST visit (familiarity=1); bw_inn_bond_return grows familiarity on each RETURN (a returning trader the innkeeper knows across visits -- relationships PERSIST, no NPCs). bw_import_buy: a resident buys a good bigville CANNOT produce (produced_locally==0) from a traveller -> coin crosses the boundary OUTWARD (external_outflux LOGGED), the resident owns_good it -- not autarkic. Composes existing Terms; zero new Rust.",
